      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.34.0"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## HOW TO: Text-to-Music & Background Scores (ACE-Step 1.5 Turbo)\n\n### 1. Single-file model download (~9.3 GB, MIT license, 100% native ComfyUI!)\n- Download [`ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ace_step_1.5_ComfyUI_files/resolve/main/checkpoints/ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors)\n- Put it in **`ComfyUI/models/checkpoints/`** and refresh ComfyUI.\n- **No custom nodes needed!** Runs in **under 10 seconds on an RTX 3090** (<4 GB VRAM).\n\n### 2. How to change LENGTH & STYLE\n- **Duration:** Change `Duration in seconds` (Node 2) \u2014 e.g. `15`, `30`, `60`, `120` (supports up to 10 minutes).\n- **Instrumental background score (default):** Describe genre, mood, instruments, and tempo in **`tags`** (Node 5) and keep **`lyrics`** set to `[Instrumental]`.\n- **Full song with vocals:** Replace `[Instrumental]` in **`lyrics`** with structured lyrics (`[Verse 1]`, `[Chorus]`, `[Outro]`) and set **`language`** (`en`, `es`, `fr`, `de`, `ja`, etc.).\n- **BPM & Key:** Adjust `bpm` (e.g. `80` slow cinematic, `120` upbeat) and `keyscale` (`D minor`, `C major`, etc.) in Node 5.\n\n### 3. Using in Your Video Pipeline\n- Drop the saved `audio/ACEStep15_Music_*.flac` into **DaVinci Resolve** as your background score, or mux it directly into **Wan 2.2** / **HunyuanVideo 1.5** via their optional `LoadAudio` branch!\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## HOW TO: Text-to-Music & Background Scores (ACE-Step 1.5 Turbo)\n\n### 1. Single-file model download (~9.3 GB, MIT license, 100% native ComfyUI!)\n- Download [`ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors`](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ace_step_1.5_ComfyUI_files/resolve/main/checkpoints/ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors)\n- Put it in **`ComfyUI/models/checkpoints/`** and refresh ComfyUI.\n- **No custom nodes needed!** Runs in **under 10 seconds on an RTX 3090** (<4 GB VRAM).\n\n### 2. How to change LENGTH & STYLE\n- **Duration:** Change `Duration in seconds` (Node 2) \u2014 e.g. `15`, `30`, `60`, `120` (supports up to 10 minutes).\n- **Instrumental background score (default):** Describe genre, mood, instruments, and tempo in **`tags`** (Node 5) and keep **`lyrics`** set to `[Instrumental]`.\n- **Full song with vocals:** Replace `[Instrumental]` in **`lyrics`** with structured lyrics (`[Verse 1]`, `[Chorus]`, `[Outro]`) and set **`language`** (`en`, `es`, `fr`, `de`, `ja`, etc.).\n- **BPM & Key:** Adjust `bpm` (e.g. `80` slow cinematic, `120` upbeat) and `keyscale` (`D minor`, `C major`, etc.) in Node 5.\n\n### 3. Using in Your Video Pipeline\n- Drop the saved `audio/ACEStep15_Music_*.flac` into **DaVinci Resolve** as your background score, or mux it directly into **Wan 2.2** / **HunyuanVideo 1.5** via their optional `LoadAudio` branch!\n"
      },
      "title": "HOW TO: Text-to-Music (ACE-Step 1.5)",
      "color": "#233",
      "bgcolor": "#355"
    }
